  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Benzotriazole&nbsp;can be prepared by treating o-phenylenediamine with nitrous acid (liberated during the reaction between sodium nitrite and acetic acid) to form mono-diazonium salt that follows spontaneous intramolecular cyclization reaction to produce benzotriazole.<img src=\"assets\\st0064_67b701db4bef.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 278px;\" /></p>"
